             Summary: Upgrade packaged Cocoon to 2.1.12
                 Key: FOR-1240
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/FOR-1240
             Project: Forrest
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: Core operations
    Affects Versions: 0.10-dev
            Reporter: David Crossley
            Priority: Critical
             Fix For: 0.10-dev


Cocoon is now preparing to release 2.1.12

Forrest is already using an older in-development version, so it should be straight-forward.

Upgrading our dependencies provides a good test of Cocoon and our interactions with it. It would be good for both projects to do this now, and then again after Cocoon does the release. Please help.

